{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-20-at-03.40.35-1-1024x801.jpeg\"/>\n<p>未到凌晨三時正，球迷已經迫爆奧海城現場，人聲鼎沸，球迷們穿上球衣，拿着各自支持的國家國旗和應援物，迎接這場四年一次的世界盃決戰。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-20-at-03.40.40-1024x649.jpeg\"/>\n<p>上半場，西班牙緊迫阿根廷，控球在腳的時間較多，阿根廷防守穩陣。阿根廷偶有反擊，水 break 前也未對西班牙構成太多的威脅。38 分鐘，西班牙奧耶沙巴爾在禁區頂施射，未能突破。約 40 分鐘，阿根廷利辛度馬天尼斯領第一面黃牌。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-20-at-03.40.40-2-1024x795.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-20-at-03.40.40-3-1024x679.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-20-at-03.40.35-1024x713.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T19:57:49.713559+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":6,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}